  tenTranh: "Tranh D\xE2n Gian \u0110\xF4ng H\u1ED3 L\xFD Ng\u01B0 V\u1ECDng Nguy\u1EC7t"
  moTa: "B\u1EE9c tranh \u0110\xF4ng H\u1ED3 \u201CL\xFD Ng\u01B0 V\u1ECDng Nguy\u1EC7t\u201D,
    c\xF2n g\u1ECDi l\xE0 \u201CC\xE1 Ch\xE9p Tr\xF4ng Tr\u0103ng\u201D, l\xE0 m\u1ED9t
    t\xE1c ph\u1EA9m ngh\u1EC7 thu\u1EADt d\xE2n gian \u0111\u1EB7c s\u1EAFc, \u1EA9n
    ch\u1EE9a nhi\u1EC1u l\u1EDBp \xFD ngh\u0129a s\xE2u xa trong t\xEDn ng\u01B0\u1EE1ng
    v\xE0 t\xE2m th\u1EE9c ng\u01B0\u1EDDi Vi\u1EC7t. Kh\xF4ng ch\u1EC9 l\xE0 h\xECnh
    \u1EA3nh quen thu\u1ED9c trong \u0111\u1EDDi s\u1ED1ng n\xF4ng th\xF4n, c\xE1
    ch\xE9p trong tranh l\xE0 bi\u1EC3u t\u01B0\u1EE3ng c\u1EE7a s\u1EF1 n\u1ED7
    l\u1EF1c, th\xE0nh c\xF4ng, v\xE0 kh\xE1t v\u1ECDng v\u01B0\u01A1n l\xEAn."
  anhTranh: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 02004e4d61c540840b275477665b3a2d, type: 3}
  amThanhThuyetMinh: {fileID: 8300000, guid: adc06ec04c5fb764db61fa945a3589a8, type: 3}
